{
  "work_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum",
  "source_path": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum.json",
  "source_language": "chu",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.166v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "24cf6a1e3e837c31",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A sermon by Photius, Patriarch of Constantinople, for Palm Sunday and on Lazarus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.166v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "46e2f7f2418f78fb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the church trumpets forth the children crying, “Hosanna in the highest,”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.166v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "14c89e3eb283e224",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and I draw that radiant, godly cry to myself, I will be lifted high in my zeal."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.166v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "a391843b441daee9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For it is dreadful if a barren nature overcomes joy; but love does not know how to wait for the time that summons it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.166v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "b7785e66509e6ae9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And in my swift mind I go about Bethany, clapping my hands and rejoicing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.166v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "9054d223dc765628",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And I mingle with the children and leap with them, joining them in raising a song of victory to the Master:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.166v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "5e07d0c25e58c68b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Hosanna in the highest! Blessed is he who comes in the name of the Lord!”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.166v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "11508d99a011589a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again, when I see them carrying branches and meeting Christ,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.166v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "8463dbcb2a06de6d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "forming choirs and spreading their garments, I rejoice"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "53dcb936a31f126c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "likewise when I see the children, with a simple tongue and [?],"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "063732865f89e4b2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "making a song for the King. But then I am moved still more to weep over and hate the wickedness of the Jews."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "b02fb39d55ab52fc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For the children show understanding, while the fathers prepare themselves for murder; and the infants speak of God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "70e9619ae4098113",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "while the fathers set themselves against God. Then I also see the fallen wisdom of the scribes themselves."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "adf3df76326d5091",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For, having wickedly exalted themselves through the glory and pretense of understanding, from true and divine wisdom"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "3d26f54f18483b99",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they have indeed fallen away. Then I also lament their teachers for the hardness of their hearts,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "7b18aa97d02cfb77",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because, though entrusted with teaching others, through their own wickedness they were not worthy even to stand in the same rank as their own pupils."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "38a080e245fd9c01",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And those who had promised to heal the sickness of others were themselves sick with the ultimate sickness, madness,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "f8dfce998837f793",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "having grievously wounded their whole soul with the passion of pride, and with a truly double wound"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "8c89c6f5a8222d36",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they suffered. For, being wicked and suffering grievously, they could not fail to feel their own suffering."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "c89026c3a1127894",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For they ought to have welcomed the physician when he came and was among them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "79948f3c94ee0bb3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "pouring out rivers of healing for them, and easily and without food, through him who washed them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "1f20fb2be448dcb7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to have cleansed their stains and washed away their passions. But, willfully and wickedly blinding both their senses and their mind"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167r.s14",
      "source_sha256": "cacc5c7481964e06",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "together, they turned away from their own healing, and their Savior and Creator"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "80ba4ba7221c60ba",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they did not wish to recognize. For, as Saint Paul said, had they known, they would not have crucified the Lord of glory."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "4cbf61a78250c586",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They did not understand, for they did not even know how to desire it. For where the will is opposed,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "89f04f62b54ba90c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "then the mind is taken captive by the passion that holds it; and the mind’s freedom, though called"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "bbbeb4071711abc7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to the good, does not attain an understanding of the truth. They did not recognize him who is glorified by angels and proclaimed by prophets."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "eca8a3f2cf4a4876",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They did not recognize him who sits at the Father’s right hand and is carried on a virgin’s arm,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "6a093dc4e6b35b9d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and sets things in motion with a single word. They did not recognize him who sits upon the throne of the cherubim,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "ecda7d7e94ef3ccb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and is carried on a donkey’s colt, and is praised by children, and came to suffer willingly."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "263875d5b4afc481",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They neither recognized him nor chose to understand. Instead, claiming to be wise, they became fools,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "1ae0fbc3693c50e1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and their foolish heart was darkened in their thoughts."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "d0e8f476723d9df5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This prophet spoke long beforehand, foreseeing: “They hear but do not understand,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "413aef4dfbde11bc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and though they look, they do not see. For the heart of these people has grown dull, and their ears have become hard of hearing,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "8ccdf90fbd9367fd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and they have closed their eyes, lest they see with their eyes, hear with their ears, understand with their heart,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "d4aadba2c3ee88ca",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and turn back so that I may heal them.” Tell me, then, O Jew, why do you boast of the prophets,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.167v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "3ceb5590059be68e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "yet revile him whom they prophesied? How can you pore over books while disregarding the meaning of what is written? And you gather the shoots"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "f53d118e80e05dbb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of the law, but neglect to gather the true clusters of grapes. And in the mines of the scriptures"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "423f1f623085b821",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you [?] in vain, but you neither dig out nor gather the gold hidden in them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "91043a2283552e2e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But others, having lovingly gathered a flower from the blossoms of the law, radiant and brightly [?],"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "2c9158ae31c29423",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "rejoice in the Church’s bridal chamber, and bear what gives off a sweet fragrance in grace—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "06628c6985706459",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "godliness. But you, having covered your eyes with leaves, have given yourself entirely to that place,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "a2b8aeec925705f0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "neither feeling distress at that dense growth nor turning your face to look at the blossom."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "8cf4eb1000148f22",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And you wickedly multiply the pearls of hell with which they adorn themselves."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "7b7847afee84d034",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But Christ’s people, uncovering it fittingly, truly receive a pure and genuine radiance."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "cd090f9f40c4f1c2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And you sit at the bridal chamber, having labored for a long time, yet you do not welcome the bridegroom who has come,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "c60d1359fa89930d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "held captive by lust for fornication, having truly gathered [?], without manliness, and alone among orphaned words, without understanding."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "628da02001fe304a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Truly these people are foolish and not wise. For from the beginning they were chosen for the law,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "58b91effd1978ae2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nor were they ranked last in the knowledge of God. Have you not heard King David singing under God’s inspiration:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "f67f5b026de107ee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Out of the mouths of nursing infants you have perfected praise, because of your enemies”? Do you not believe"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "3225bd2edc25288d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Believe the prophet as a kinsman, if you have not renounced your kinship in words as well."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "95e1974b5a284da7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For I have long known that you have renounced him by your deeds."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "002d43aadee6e589",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Even if you disregard him as a shepherd, fear him as a king."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "8bf46e516c6dbb52",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For, being a king, he knows how to threaten if he perceives anyone being negligent or angry."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "ccefcb3d3a6f23bf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He will bring a flashing spear against them and shepherd them with an iron rod, and like clay vessels"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "7c82216a2c501f1e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he will shatter the things fashioned by a corrupt mind. Say with him in a loud voice:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "8207741fbed28ad5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Out of the mouths of infants and nursing children you have perfected praise.” The Savior has come, wishing to take vengeance on your understanding."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "56472d1363670a3b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Wishing to take vengeance on yours, he establishes the praise of infants. Why do you begrudge your own salvation?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "497797e4819441fd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Why are you so unwilling to receive a kindness? Even if this too seems evil to you, it is for your good."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "b52cb76f33017926",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Nevertheless, he will overcome your malice. Do you refuse to heed what you hear?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "da2c0ce703ec7eda",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then heed what can be seen. Do you not believe the prophet Isaiah, who cries out and says:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "8dc1b09ed98d9f3c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Tongues will learn to speak peace concerning him”? Do not tongues plainly speak the truth concerning him?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "acbff7361f744bfd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Have the children of the world not learned to offer praise? For Christ is our peace, who tore down the dividing wall of hostility,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.168v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "a5f6af5b8bd5b0e9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and through whom, after previously falling away wickedly, we were reconciled with the Father and Creator"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "6ad8c1bb14046eac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "again. Did not Zechariah, through the Holy Spirit, proclaim this joy to Zion beforehand, saying, “Rejoice greatly, daughter of Zion!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "bfd2765ff0c1ef24",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Proclaim it, daughter of Jerusalem! Look, your king is coming to you, righteous"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "1bd20417045b1079",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and bringing salvation. He is gentle and mounted on a donkey, on a donkey’s colt.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "b40a62032be084ac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do you not have your own eyes as witnesses to what was foretold? Have you not heard what was prophesied?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "64a12d564b1d5533",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You see that very thing standing before you. Has the deed not come together with the words? Is he not gentle? Is he not righteous?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "21359fa17b7c02e9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Does he not bring salvation? Has he not mounted a donkey? Do not tongues clearly proclaim peace concerning him?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "ee2ebcc8874a9cce",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do not children offer him praise, possessing the understanding of elders? Children offer praise"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "38a43a8dfc76a0b7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that he may expose all envy as empty words of hostility."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "7b48aced8d779490",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For even someone wishing to act maliciously [?] some cunning and a desire to please in this life, those who offer praise and glorify"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "de0ace3cafa8e2c1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the Master will be spared. For the nature of children knows neither cunning nor deceit,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "574cffe74f7c8be9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nor is it enslaved to the passion for flattery, but just as the gift of the Holy Spirit puts it into their ears."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "363e1ec8f425f20a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Thus this man places the gift of the Holy Spirit into their ears, into their ears. Thus they praise the miracle. Children bring gifts, so that everyone, through deeds,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "e6b58c5d68a4a7a9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "may learn that it is not those who have a [?] mind,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "1bceecd74236ee94",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and are fond of disputes and wish to incur shame, to whom the mysterious gift is given."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "cb69ad1e40efba6d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Rather, it is those who approach with a pure mind and an innocent heart."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "4628af35bbb57f31",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "To them the understanding of godliness is revealed. For that which is beyond investigation—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "b248d4c4725bb6e1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "if anyone insists on investigating it, rather than following the holy words, then even nature’s [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "44b909bfddcffdd6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the words in which he boasts he will grievously tear apart, and he will revile the law of theology."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "bf927c054a05fda0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he will revile his [?], and lose the holiness he investigates. Children offer praise,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "d22b6b9bbe01f267",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that they may expose their parents’ lawlessness and renew the knowledge of God among believers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "4e74d2858816c7b9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For whatever surpasses the mind [?], and they learn improperly through thought [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "ced5ab2cefcc40b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Much [?] knows [?]; holy [?] is needed. But that which dwells in pure hearts without defilement"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "9e7f7bb41f84206b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "reveals true understanding to others through them. But do you not see Lazarus risen from the tomb,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "94d0509ecdb113bf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the dead man among the living, reclining at supper with the Lord?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "2a3d407ec071c487",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Yet you untie the dead man’s burial wrappings, but do not undo your own unbelief. And you roll away the tombstone,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.169v.s14",
      "source_sha256": "b5d1a708020098a8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but you do not cast out the envy from your soul, which produces worse pus for you. And you see Hades, at the Lord’s"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "7fac3947f971f00a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "command, giving up the man who had been dead for four days. Yet, to murder the very one who raised him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "0abe7768018e852b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you sharpen the hands that killed the prophets. Oh, what exceedingly great folly!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "36fbe538d95ec428",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Oh, what exceedingly great, incurable hardness of heart! Have they turned their minds to such lawlessness"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "a9b64c6c7d0d5344",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that they do not believe because of the very things that should have led them to believe? They revile him for the very things for which they should praise him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "ff66d4727c1c0677",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For the things for which they should glorify and magnify him, they do not call him blessed. For the things for which they should sing and give thanks,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "05651790a3481cf6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they condemn him and become fighters against God. Such is the madness of both groups."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "1fd2c76f5da1e4db",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Such is their [?] restraint. For [?], having intoxicated their minds with delusion and [?], does not allow"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "de9feb6615acfefd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the mind’s eye to see through the darkness poured over it,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "c09bd544265a13dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "or to look upon the rays of truth. Such is the sickness of the Pharisees and scribes, who prize the foremost places at feasts"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "9d6b85f7b74ab1f4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and take pride in being called teachers, and boast of the breadth of their fringes, imagining that they are keeping the Law."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "156d89f5c29e41c5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "having no truth in them at all, and speaking not a single word of godliness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "cea5848519ca75c2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Such is the sting of envy: once it has driven envy deep into the soul, it wounds the whole person."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "84509b48e3db0596",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It destroys the ability to care for what is good, and the senses, which are the most necessary"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "7c736d72022d3675",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "pathways to learning, it drives away most cruelly, neither allowing one to understand what is fitting nor strengthening what one hears through memory,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "7148341841aa1f62",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nor allowing one to see visible things clearly. But let us, beloved, flee these passions that harm the soul."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "ed0423aeca215f51",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us flee arrogance, because of which the leader of the bodiless powers fell at the beginning."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "5893b534329b65b9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us flee envy, if for no other reason than that it harms the one who practices it,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "d866ee71732a7b01",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "even if it causes little distress to the person he envies. Let us flee arrogance and glory,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "68ae859a070f1bd0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "by which the understanding of truth is driven away. Let us flee ingratitude and blasphemy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "12f6261f1f8605a7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For these drove the chief priests and the Jewish scribes into a frenzy to murder Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "17f369c8d7eca004",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This made the chief priests and scribes more foolish than infants."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "f60b45763a61b1f2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us not imitate the foolishness of the Jews, but emulate the children’s thanksgiving,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "2887b79d83a48fff",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "not the elders’ [?], but the infants’ praise of God; not the ignorance of the envious,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "79a3f89fe7fc4a7d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but the knowledge of God shown by those who praise him; not the hostility of murderers, but the innocence of the young."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "f4d8042dd3205e46",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us also become like children, for the Lord said, “Unless you turn and become like children,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.170v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "2b1b2f60161ad28d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you will not enter the kingdom of heaven.” Let us be children without malice,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "372eb9d5ac11355f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "inscribing nothing evil or cruel upon the soul, but with complete purity and without any mark of evil,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "2817ecec2a2943d8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "receiving and inscribing the godly faith, so that we may enter the kingdom of heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "22ce1ed5ca783008",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us bring the Lord branches of mercy and love for humanity, so that we may enter the kingdom of heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "641d5335d06be621",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let us meet him as he comes riding on a colt, exposing the foolishness of the Jews"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "706c6996881e6c81",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and granting holiness to the nations. Let us meet him, spreading cloaks. How?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "58c5595b3a99e3ce",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "By spreading them for the poor. For he himself took poverty upon himself and cries out,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "05c78b9ce7feb7be",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Inasmuch as you did it to one of these least of my brothers, you did it to me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "ab37f6d2d23da252",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Oh, what a loving and holy voice! “You spread cloaks for me,” he says, “when you clothe the poor."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "32d2f1bfe320bdbf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You warm me when you relieve them of bitter cold and suffering.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "7953a8f95d0225dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "We spread our cloaks for him, so that with the children we may cry out for deliverance."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "f65f504d7ab02599",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "Hosanna in the highest! Blessed is he who comes in the name of the Lord!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "3a55e7e6b78fbb60",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "Blessed is he who comes to stretch out his hands on the cross and gather the nations to himself. Blessed is he who comes"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "866eb552a37583f9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "to show Hades bound, to release Adam from his bonds, and to raise up the fallen. Blessed is he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "0287e5195431b8e9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "who comes. He will crush the power of torment and, coming in the last days, grant forgiveness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "fde2da3b8903243c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "Blessed is he who comes. He will empty the dwellings of Hades, but the heavenly dwellings"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "047fccac92c42a52",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "he will fill with many who are being saved. Blessed is he who comes. He will offer himself as a sacrifice for us,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "2796adc4a644b328",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "and cleanse all sins and reconcile us with the Father."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "5f8544b7e3ac4265",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "Blessed is he who comes to curse death and renew resurrection for us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "82f676baf12e7d40",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "He will free us from slavery and grant us adoption as God's children. For this belongs to you, Lord, who created us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "a2d2c7ad39fa4567",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "and brought us into being from nothing and fashioned us, and, when we have fallen, once more,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "d18757807e03dbac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "and when we have been broken, to raise us up and reshape us. This belongs to your love for humankind:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "bc78c583341c65a3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "to seek out the one who has gone astray and turn him back from error,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "7f51cf5992d7aa1d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "and make him worthy of his original place. For we are your people and the sheep of your pasture,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "254ca7efb4be22d8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "and we all rely on you, and we give you glory and thanks,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "6cef1dfe35492177",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "together with the Father and the Holy Spirit, to the Trinity, one in essence, life-giving,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/photius-in-ramos-palmarum#Supr.171v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "121064a32a9d5b1d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 17,
      "text": "and almighty, now and always and forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
